{"duration_api_ms":146794,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"1e3db15b-4e66-445c-a28f-01bf1f9ccabc","total_cost_usd":0.1967,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13184,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":14396,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":8905},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13184,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":14396,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13184,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13184},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":14396,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":13184,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.1967,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":8905,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"Round 2 lost 18 of 20 evaluations to 'aero surface extrapolation' failures. Every failure has bluntness >= 1.24 at cone 70, plus (1.2, cone 69). All the successful high-bluntness points sit at cone 70 with bluntness <= 1.2, or at (1.12, cone 68). The valid region for the cd_fore surrogate therefore ends at bluntness ~1.2 on the cone=70 edge, and inside that the edge runs roughly from (1.12, 68) to (1.2, 70). The feasible front is only 3 points, clustered at ~280-290 kW/m2 and ~393-394 K. Bondline temperature has the larger hypervolume leverage: 1 K is worth about as much as ~40 kW/m2 of flux. The binding constraints are max_g (limit 12, near gamma ~ -3.58) and heatshield mass fraction (limit reached near D ~3.38). The nearly feasible C-3583b7488cf2 (b=1.2, cone 70, gamma -3.6) has the lowest temperature (392.3 K) and fails max_g by only 0.13%.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-3583b7488cf2: b=1.2, cone 70, D=3.3, gamma -3.6 gives 285.6 kW/m2, 392.29 K, g=12.016, so it is infeasible by 0.13%. Gamma -3.58 should be just feasible.\",\"g rises about 1.7 g/deg of steepening: C-05ff421c45e2 (gamma -3.4) gives 11.70 g and C-b57da803fe39 (gamma -3.55) gives 11.95 g. That puts the g limit near gamma -3.58 to -3.59.\",\"Mass-fraction margin falls as D grows: D=3.3 gives 0.046-0.050 (C-bd537396e7e1, C-3583b7488cf2), D=3.35 gives 0.015-0.018 (C-05ff421c45e2, C-b57da803fe39), and D=3.74 gives -0.37 (C-0a0993b4b67b). That is about 0.6-0.9 per metre, so D <= ~3.37 is needed.\",\"Every one of the 18 round-2 failures (e.g. C-ec5c054f9438, C-460ff98d4dde) has b>=1.24, or b=1.2 with cone 69. These are all outside the hull, while C-3583b7488cf2 (1.2, cone 70) is valid.\",\"Shallower gamma lowers flux and raises temperature: C-05ff421c45e2 (-3.4) has 279k and 394.0 K, versus C-b57da803fe39 (-3.55) at 288.5k and 393.2 K. This supports a few shallow-gamma points to spread the front.\"],\"mechanism\":\"Peak flux scales roughly as sqrt(rho_peak/Rn), with rho_peak proportional to ballistic coefficient times sin(gamma). Flux therefore falls with a larger D (about D^-1.5), with a larger nose radius (higher bluntness), and with a shallower gamma. Bondline temperature follows the integrated heat load. Steeper entry shortens the pulse and lowers temperature, until the max_g cap is hit at about -3.58 deg. Maximum cone angle (70) and bluntness of about 1.2 minimise both objectives, and D is pushed to the mass-fraction limit near 3.36-3.38. I stay strictly inside the known-valid bluntness/cone region (cone 70 with b<=1.2, plus a few interior points). I probe b=1.22 once to locate the hull edge. A handful of shallow-gamma points at b=1.2 extend the front toward low flux. Flux and temperature predictions come from a simple scaling anchored on C-3583b7488cf2, which is prior-knowledge physics, not a fit.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The exact hull boundary between b=1.2 and b=1.24 at cone 70 is unknown, so the b=1.22 probe may fail. The g margin near gamma -3.58 is about 0.2% and depends slightly on b and D, so some steep-gamma points may narrowly fail. The mass-fraction margin at D >= 3.37 is extrapolated from few points and may depend on gamma through heat load. The temperature rise at very shallow gamma (-2 to -3) is extrapolated with high uncertainty.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-3583b7488cf2\",\"rationale\":\"Keep the best-temperature design and steepen only slightly to clear max_g (-3.6 fails by 0.13%).\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":284800,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Likely a new non-dominated point with the lowest temperature seen; tests the g edge.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-3583b7488cf2\",\"rationale\":\"Slightly larger D lowers flux while keeping mass fraction margin, at the g edge.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.34,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":279700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the D benefit on flux at b=1.2 and cone 70.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-3583b7488cf2\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.36 with b=1.2 and cone 70 targets the flux/temperature corner near the mass-fraction limit.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":277100,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Probes the corner of the feasible region where both objectives are best.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-3583b7488cf2\",\"rationale\":\"The same D with less steep gamma gives g margin and slightly lower flux.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":276000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Safer g margin (~11.93) at low flux and low temperature.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-3583b7488cf2\",\"rationale\":\"Trade a little temperature for lower flux, with a comfortable g margin.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills in the front between gamma -3.4 and -3.58 at b=1.2.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-3583b7488cf2\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.37 pushes toward the mass-fraction limit for lower flux.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.37,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.57},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":275600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Locates where the mass-fraction margin goes to zero.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-3583b7488cf2\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.38 is the mass-fraction edge (margin extrapolated to ~0.002).\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Finds the largest feasible D, which gives the lowest flux.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-3583b7488cf2\",\"rationale\":\"A smaller D than the others gives a more conservative mass margin while still steep.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.32,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":282600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills in the D dependence between 3.3 and 3.34.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-05ff421c45e2\",\"rationale\":\"Raise b to 1.2 (a valid hull point at cone 70) at moderate gamma for lower flux and temperature.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":275000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks the b effect at D=3.35, cone 70.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-05ff421c45e2\",\"rationale\":\"An intermediate b=1.16 stays well inside the hull at cone 70.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"bluntness_ratio\":1.16,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":281000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Maps the b dependence at fixed D=3.35 and steep gamma.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-05ff421c45e2\",\"rationale\":\"Moderate gamma at b=1.2 for a mid-front point.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.45},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Extends the front toward lower flux with only a small temperature rise.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-05ff421c45e2\",\"rationale\":\"Single probe of the hull edge just above b=1.2 (failures start at 1.24).\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"bluntness_ratio\":1.22,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Locates the valid bluntness limit at cone 70 with one evaluation.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-05ff421c45e2\",\"rationale\":\"Shallow entry at b=1.2 covers the low-flux end of the trade-off.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.2},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":263000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gives front coverage at lower flux.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-05ff421c45e2\",\"rationale\":\"Shallower again to spread the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":254800,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":396.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the flux/temperature slope at shallow gamma.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-05ff421c45e2\",\"rationale\":\"Very shallow entry sets the low-flux extreme of the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":232500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":400.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks whether the low-flux end of the front is worth its temperature penalty.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-05ff421c45e2\",\"rationale\":\"Extreme shallow point to bound the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":207900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":407.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Bounds temperature growth and mass-fraction change at shallow gamma.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-b57da803fe39\",\"rationale\":\"Raise b from 1.0 to 1.2 and steepen slightly, keeping D=3.35 and cone 70.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":278300,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Direct comparison with the front points at D=3.35.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-bd537396e7e1\",\"rationale\":\"Interior hull point (cone 69.5, b=1.15 is inside the (1.12,68)-(1.2,70) edge) with larger D.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":69.5,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.15,\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.57},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":279500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests whether cone below 70 costs much and whether the hull edge is where I estimate.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-bd537396e7e1\",\"rationale\":\"Cone 69 with b=1.12 is safely inside the hull; larger D and a slightly steeper gamma.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":69.0,\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.57},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":286000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Measures the cone-angle sensitivity of flux and mass fraction.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-b57da803fe39\",\"rationale\":\"Lower b with a larger D and steeper gamma tests whether D compensates for a smaller nose radius.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"bluntness_ratio\":1.05,\"diameter_m\":3.37,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":284000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Separates the b effect from the D effect at the mass-fraction limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}